            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "माझ्या सहप्रवाशाने मला पाणी दिलं. mājhyā sahapravāśāne malā pāṇī dilaṁ. My fellow traveller gave me some water."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सह- means together with; before -ने and -ला it becomes सहप्रवाशा-."
            }
          ]
        },
