          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सहप्रवासी (sahapravāsī) is a compound of Sanskrit saha, \"together with\" (Monier-Williams), and प्रवासी, \"a traveller\", built on Sanskrit pravāsa, \"a journey abroad\"."
